          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 103008,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Arrow fonksiyonlarıyla çalışmaya biraz daha alışalım. Bunu yapmak için arrow fonksiyonlarının içinde parametrelerin nasıl kullanılacağına bakacağız.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getPrice = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"discount\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" - (discount * \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getPrice(\" /><text value=\"0.25\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"26\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"375\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>discount</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Arrow fonksiyonlarıyla çalışmaya biraz daha alışalım. Bunu yapmak için arrow fonksiyonlarının içinde parametrelerin nasıl kullanılacağına bakacağız.</p><p><code>getPrice</code> fonksiyonuna geçirilen indirimi kullanarak %25 indirimin sonucunu <code>375</code> yap.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getPrice = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"discount\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" - (discount * \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getPrice(\" /><text value=\"0.25\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"getTotal\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"tax\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0.5\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"250\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"375\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>getPrice</code>, ardından <code>discount</code> ve son olarak <code>0.25</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "One parameter",
            "id": 103009,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ok fonksiyonlarındaki parametreler, normal fonksiyonlardaki parametrelere benzer. Parametre olarak <code>total</code> kullanan bir ok fonksiyonu kodla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getPrice = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"total\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" discount = \" /><text value=\"0.10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total - (discount * total);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getPrice(\" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"27\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"450\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>=</code>, ardından <code>(</code> ve sonra <code>total</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>=&gt;</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ok fonksiyonlarındaki parametreler, normal fonksiyonlardaki parametrelere benzer.</p><p><code>getPrice(500)</code> çağrısının %10 indirim uygulayıp <code>450</code> görüntülemesi için fonksiyonu tamamla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getPrice = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"total\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" discount = \" /><text value=\"0.10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total - (discount * total);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getPrice(\" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"113\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"getTotal\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"discount\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"function\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"console.log\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"450\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>getPrice</code>, ardından <code>total</code>, <code>=&gt;</code>, <code>return</code> ve son olarak <code>getPrice</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "One parameter II",
            "id": 103324,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ok fonksiyonlarında yalnızca bir parametre varsa parantez eklememiz gerekmez. <code>total</code> parametresini kodla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getPrice = \" /><text value=\"total\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" discount = \" /><text value=\"0.10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total - (discount * total);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getPrice(\" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"22\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"450\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>total</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Default parameter value",
            "id": 103010,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Parametre değerleri varsayılan olarak <code>undefined</code> olarak ayarlanır. Bir fonksiyon çağrısı bir değer iletmezse fonksiyon, değer olarak <code>undefined</code> kullanır.</p><p>Aşağıdaki <code>getPrice()</code> fonksiyonunu çağırarak <code>NaN</code> görüntülediğini gör. Bu, tanımsız bir değer olduğu anlamına gelir.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getPrice = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"total\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" tax = \" /><text value=\"0.16\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total + (tax * total);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getPrice());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"95\" endIndex=\"103\" /><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"104\" /><option startIndex=\"104\" endIndex=\"105\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"NaN\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>getPrice</code>, ardından <code>(</code> ve son olarak <code>)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Parametre değerleri varsayılan olarak <code>undefined</code> olarak ayarlanır. Bir fonksiyon çağrısı bir değer iletmezse fonksiyon, değer olarak <code>undefined</code> kullanır.</p><p><code>getPrice</code> fonksiyonunu değer olmadan çağırmanın sonucunu, yani <code>NaN</code> değerini göstermek için <code>console.log</code> kullan.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getPrice = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"total\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" tax = \" /><text value=\"0.16\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total + (tax * total);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getPrice());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option startIndex=\"95\" endIndex=\"105\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"tax\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"console.error\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"getPrice(0)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"total()\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"NaN\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>total</code>, ardından <code>console.log</code> ve son olarak <code>getPrice()</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Default parameter value II",
            "id": 103108,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tanımsız değerlerden kaçınmak için varsayılan değeri parantezlerin içinde belirtiriz.</p><p>Parantezlerin içindeki varsayılan parametre değerini <code>total=200</code> olarak ayarla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getPrice = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"total = \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" discount = \" /><text value=\"0.16\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total - (discount * total);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getPrice());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"29\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"168\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>total</code>, ardından <code>=</code> ve son olarak <code>200</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tanımsız değerlerden kaçınmak için parantez içinde <code>=</code> ile varsayılan değer ayarla, örneğin <code>total = 200</code>.</p><p>Varsayılan toplam olarak <code>200</code> kullan, ardından <code>168</code> görüntülemek için fonksiyonu argümansız çağır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getPrice = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"total = \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" discount = \" /><text value=\"0.16\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total - (discount * total);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getPrice());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"111\" endIndex=\"121\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"discount\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"getPrice(200)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"168\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>total</code>, ardından <code>=</code>, <code>200</code> ve son olarak <code>getPrice()</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Multiple parameters",
            "id": 103011,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Birden fazla parametre kullanmak için parantez içine yeni parametreyi ekler ve virgül <code>,</code> ekleyerek onu diğerlerinden ayırırız.</p><p>Ek bir varsayılan parametre ekle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getPrice = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"total = \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", discount = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" total - (discount /\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" * total);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getPrice());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\";\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"194\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>,</code>, ardından <code>discount</code> ve sonra <code>=</code>, <code>3</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Birden fazla parametre kullanmak için parantez içine yeni parametreyi ekler ve virgül <code>,</code> ekleyerek onu diğerlerinden ayırırız.</p><p>Argümansız çağrının <code>194</code> görüntülemesini sağlayan varsayılan indirimi ekle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getPrice = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"total = \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", discount = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" total - (discount /\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" * total);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getPrice());\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\";\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"tax\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"*\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"194\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>,</code>, ardından <code>discount</code>, <code>=</code>, <code>3</code>, <code>/</code> ve son olarak <code>100</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Summary",
            "id": 103323,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Arrow fonksiyonları daha kısa ve öz kod yazmamızı sağlar. Bunları nasıl yazacağımız, kullandığımız parametrelere ve kod bloğunun boyutuna bağlıdır.</p><p>Daha sonra React gibi daha karmaşık kodlarda kullanacağımız bu fonksiyonlar çok önemli olacak.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getPrice = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"total\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" discount = \" /><text value=\"0.10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total - (discount * total);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getPrice(\" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"27\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"450\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>=&gt;</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Arrow fonksiyonları daha kısa ve öz kod yazmamızı sağlar. Bunları nasıl yazacağımız, kullandığımız parametrelere ve kod bloğunun boyutuna bağlıdır.</p><p><code>500</code> değerine %10 indirim uygulayan ok fonksiyonunu ve çağrıyı tamamla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getPrice = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"total\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" discount = \" /><text value=\"0.10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total - (discount * total);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getPrice(\" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"113\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"function\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"getPrice()\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"return\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"450\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>getPrice</code>, ardından <code>=&gt;</code> ve son olarak <code>getPrice</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: One parameter",
            "id": 103683,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aşağıdaki kodda sorun nedir?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getTitle =&gt; movie {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;20th Century: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + movie;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>movie</code> parametresi <code>=</code> işaretinden sonra ve <code>=&gt;</code> işaretinden önce gelmelidir</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>movie</code> parametresi parantezlerden <code>()</code> önce gelmelidir</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>movie</code> parametresi <code>=</code> işaretinden sonra ve <code>=&gt;</code> işaretinden önce gelmelidir.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gösterilen kodu, oluşturulan film başlığını döndüren bir fonksiyona hangi iki değişiklik dönüştürür?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getTitle =&gt; movie {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;20th Century: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + movie;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>movie</code> değişkenini <code>=</code> ile <code>=&gt;</code> arasına koy ve oluşturulan dizeyi döndür.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>getTitle</code> değişkenini <code>=&gt;</code> sonrasına taşı ve dizeyi fonksiyon içinde konsola kaydet.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>movie</code> değişkenini fonksiyon gövdesinin sonrasına taşı ve süslü parantezleri kaldır.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>movie</code> değişkenini <code>=</code> ile <code>=&gt;</code> arasına koy ve oluşturulan dizeyi döndür.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: One parameter II",
            "id": 103684,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aşağıdaki kodu nasıl kısaltabiliriz?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getDouble = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" number * \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getDouble(\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"8\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>number</code> etrafındaki <code>()</code> parantezlerini kaldırarak</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Süslü parantezleri <code>{}</code> kaldırarak</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>number</code> etrafındaki <code>()</code> parantezlerini kaldırarak.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Hangi değişiklik <code>getDouble(4)</code> çağrısını geçerli tutup yine <code>8</code> çıktısını verir?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getDouble = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" number * \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getDouble(\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"8\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>number</code> etrafındaki <code>()</code> parantezlerini kaldırarak</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>number * 2</code> öncesindeki <code>=&gt;</code> kaldırılarak</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>number</code> kaldırılıp boş parantezler <code>()</code> bırakılarak</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>number</code> etrafındaki <code>()</code> parantezlerini kaldırarak.</p></body></html>"
